      "content": "KINGS LANGLEY          \tCHURCH LANE TL 0702  \t\t\t\t\t(South side)                                        13/126                                  \tHyde Monument in -               \t\t\t\tAll Saints Churchyard                                         \t(16m to E of church) GV                                     \t\tII Monument. 1801 or earlier, to Elizabeth Hyde. Portland stone. A heavy blunt obelisk raised on a square base with moulded capping, moulded base,  and inscription on its W face.  W face of obelisk has long illegible inscription. Listing NGR: TL0736402480"
